<Layout title="Works of Chaos and Pandemonium">
  <article class="readme">
    <div class="eyebrow">Read Me</div>
    <h1>Works of Chaos<br />and Pandemonium</h1>

    <div class="meta" style="margin-bottom: 42px;">
      <span>Created May 14, 2026</span>
      <span>Last Edited June 26, 2026</span>
    </div>

    <div class="readme-content">
      <p>Hello. And welcome. You are safe and protected here.</p>

      <p>And it doesn’t matter if you are friend or foe, this space is open and accessible to all once you’ve found the key, which you’ve proven to have done.</p>

      <p>This is the Works of Chaos and Pandemonium, where I share my journal entries that are the most artistic and emotionally vulnerable to those who care.</p>

      <p>…</p>

      <p>Since you are here, that means you care. Thank you for caring.</p>

      <p>I typically write the occasional journal entry whenever I feel like continuing the habit, and recently I’ve been writing more artistically, so I’ve decided to put up this google drive folder.</p>

      <h2>Ok. Some background info.</h2>

      <p>I started writing this journal from my Angles in Writing (English) class, to where I received a writing assignment called “Why I Write”, where I was able to talk about the loss of time (similar to the “I don’t feel older”) and how I celebrate happiness alone with myself (“Bondage” is inspired by this). This assignment started my journals, where I finally started to realize the true benefit of writing (and also music, hence my love for Laufey).</p>

      <h2>Some most important advice for you:</h2>

      <p>Let the wave of emotions wash over you. Don’t submerge in them as I have far too often. Please, do not tell me “I’ve figured out your secret!” or whatnot. Just enjoy the fact that I am being vulnerable to the universe, leaving the door slightly open for you to explore what I have in store.</p>

      <p>Lastly, take the emotions I’ve poured into this folder, and see where you can better yourself. Maybe you feel the same way about time, or feel like you can start journaling and writing as well. Make sure my effort and time don’t go to waste to ignorant minds.</p>

      <p>Thank you, genuinely, and enjoy reading!</p>

      <p>Best Regards,<br />TheChaosInChat<br />A strong “subjects on all emails” supporter</p>

      <h2>Ideas</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>Poem of building standing tall (if a building can stand tall, what about me)</li>
        <li>Secrets: why they exist, how they even exist without truth serum or memory erasing magic, and the danger that many of them hold both socially and politically</li>
        <li>Intimidation (?)</li>
        <li>The broken ways of education; how they are job focused (professor said so) and no longer about learning for the sake of learning, but for a “future” with money and “success”</li>
        <li>Rumor can spread like wildfire within all environments, especially teenage or parental environments (use this when something traumatic or etc happens)</li>
        <li>Taking life too much in its full form rather than relax</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
